# git-lfs is deliberately NOT used here. A plain `git clone` has to produce a
# runnable project on a machine that has nothing but git and Godot installed.
# With an lfs filter these files check out as 133-byte pointer text instead of
# geometry, and Godot's ufbx importer fails with "Unrecognized file format",
# which silently leaves the weapon viewmodel with no mesh at all.
*.glb binary
*.fbx binary
*.gltf -text
*.bin binary
